<section class="docs-section">
  <h2 id="rm-sequencing">Sequencing rule</h2>
  <p><strong>Build the docs shell thin, then never add a component without its
     page.</strong> Docs without components is an empty shell; components
     without docs are a pile of CSS.</p>
</section>

<section class="docs-section">
  <h2 id="rm-now">Where this docs site stands</h2>
  <p>Ten components have full pages: the five shipping shells (bottom-nav,
     rail, drawer, auth, lists), the 0.1 building blocks (buttons, cards)
     and the 0.3 form family (text fields, selection controls, select).
     Dialog and bottom sheet are honest stubs marked <em>Planned · 0.4</em>
     until the overlay work lands — the sidebar only ever links somewhere
     real.</p>
</section>
